                <head>124. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On March 22, 1962, Secretary of Defense McNamara, Admiral Felt, Ambassador
                    Nolting, General Harkins, and numerous other officials met at CINCPAC
                    Headquarters in Honolulu for the fourth Secretary of Defenseʼs Conference. A
                    full record of the meeting is in Washington National Records Center, RG 84,
                    Saigon Embassy Files: FRC 68 A 5159, SecDef Conf., Mar. 1962. For a summary
                    record, see <ref target="#d125">Document 125</ref>. Regarding the third Honolulu
                    Conference, February 19, see <ref target="#d71">Document 71</ref>.</p>
            </div>
